== Walkthrough ==

Upon creating an Ogre Shaman, you will have a tattered note in your inventory. The note reads as follows:

: Find Zulort. . .Give note. . .Follow Zulort. . .Follow Greenbloods.

Upon handing the note to [[Zulort]]:

: [[Zulort]] says, 'Take, take.. You now Shaman of War.. Zulort make you majik, too. When you [gonna help] u tell Zulort.'

<div class='facblock'>
* Your faction standing with [[Shamen of War]] got better.
</div>

{{YouGainExperience}}

You also receive the [[Dirty Patched Fur Tunic*]]. Good luck, Shaman!

